-- test: ADR 0067 amendment (Leonardo, 2026-10-06), A20_fold_max_like_c: a T value decided by comparing T values goes where a value of T is expected (a lambda, a higher-order function, a function result, an `edit` binding or a field of the body), which edition 0.2 rejects in the generic body; the control, sound, is rejected there, a cost Leonardo accepted, since accepting it soundly would need re-checking lambdas (spec/07 §7 rule 8, #92)
-- spec: spec/07 §7
-- expect: error U4001 at src/a20_fold_max_like_c.una:6:61
module a20_fold_max_like_c

best[T](xs: List[T], y: T) -> T = xs.fold(initial: y, step: fn(acc, x) -> if x == acc then x else acc)

pub leak(s: Int) -> Int = best([[s]], y: [0]).len
